<?xml version="1.0" ?>
<AUTOSAR xmlns="http://autosar.org/schema/r4.0" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://autosar.org/schema/r4.0 AUTOSAR_00046.xsd">
  <ADMIN-DATA>
    <DOC-REVISIONS>
      <DOC-REVISION>
        <REVISION-LABEL>4.4.0</REVISION-LABEL>
        <ISSUED-BY>AUTOSAR</ISSUED-BY>
      </DOC-REVISION>
    </DOC-REVISIONS>
  </ADMIN-DATA>
  <AR-PACKAGES>
    <AR-PACKAGE UUID="ECUC:AUTOSAR">
      <SHORT-NAME>AUTOSAR</SHORT-NAME>
      <AR-PACKAGES>
        <AR-PACKAGE UUID="ECUC:ECUCDEFS">
          <SHORT-NAME>EcucDefs</SHORT-NAME>
          <ELEMENTS>
            <ECUC-MODULE-DEF UUID="ECUC:9fe4bd2d-b284-4b83-a09c-b4cebf548834">
              <SHORT-NAME>CanIf</SHORT-NAME>
              <DESC>
                <L-2 L="EN">This container includes all necessary configuration sub-containers according the CAN Interface configuration structure.</L-2>
                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIf是Controller Area Network Interface的缩写，它提供了一个抽象层，使上层软件（如应用层和网络管理）能够通过标准的API访问CAN控制器和CAN转换器。</L-2>
                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanIf时，需要确保其与底层CAN驱动和硬件的兼容性；根据AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准，应当遵循其配置参数和初始化流程的规定；在多通道CAN系统中，正确配置每个通道的参数至关重要。</L-2>
              </DESC>
              <ADMIN-DATA>
                <DOC-REVISIONS>
                  <DOC-REVISION>
                    <REVISION-LABEL>4.4.0</REVISION-LABEL>
                    <ISSUED-BY>AUTOSAR</ISSUED-BY>
                  </DOC-REVISION>
                </DOC-REVISIONS>
              </ADMIN-DATA>
              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00244</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-SUPPORT>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-SUPPORT>
              <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANTS>
                <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>
                <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>
                <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>
              </SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANTS>
              <CONTAINERS>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:4ff0a387-1540-4a20-b4fd-7e4db255693c">
                  <SHORT-NAME>CanIfCtrlDrvCfg</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">Configuration parameters for all the underlying CAN Driver modules are aggregated under this container. For each CAN Driver module a seperate instance of this container has to be provided.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfCtrlDrvCfg 是用于定义CAN接口控制器和底层驱动之间的配置关系，确保CAN通信接口的正确配置和操作。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanIfCtrlDrvCfg时，必须确保每个控制器的配置与实际硬件和驱动兼容；配置错误可能导致通信失败或系统不稳定；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对此配置项的具体参数和结构有明确规定，应严格遵守。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00253</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                  <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                  </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <REFERENCES>
                  </REFERENCES>
                  <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:246d0d0a-4754-4319-bd38-a8b3c421e928">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanIfCtrlCfg</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) of an adressed CAN controller by an underlying CAN Driver module. This container is configurable per CAN controller.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfCtrlCfg 是一个配置项，用于定义CAN接口模块中的控制器配置参数，包括控制器的引用、唤醒功能和硬件对象的设置等。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanIfCtrlCfg时，需要确保控制器的ID和硬件资源匹配正确；如果启用了控制器的唤醒功能，还需要配置相应的唤醒源和唤醒事件处理；此外，要注意与CAN驱动模块的配置一致性，以保证CAN通信的正确性。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00546</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:a822b4db-6043-422c-aa90-e16e7963d3fd">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanIfCtrlWakeupSupport</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines if a respective controller of the referenced CAN Driver modules is queriable for wake up events.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfCtrlWakeupSupport配置项用于定义CAN接口控制器是否支持唤醒功能，这决定了控制器是否能够通过网络唤醒车辆的电子控制单元（ECU）。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保硬件支持唤醒功能；若ECU需通过CAN网络唤醒，则此配置必须启用；不正确的配置可能导致唤醒功能不可用或系统功耗异常。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">True: Enabled
                                                False: Disabled</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00637</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:a8a153f3-d90b-4927-99eb-a14bf9c518e2">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanIfCtrlId</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This parameter abstracts from the CAN Driver specific parameter Controller. Each controller of all connected CAN Driver modules shall be assigned to one specific ControllerId of the CanIf.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfCtrlId 是用于标识CAN接口控制器的唯一标识符，用于配置和管理不同的CAN控制器。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保每个CanIfCtrlId在系统中是唯一的，以避免配置冲突；正确匹配CanIfCtrlId与实际硬件控制器，以保证通信的正确性；在配置过程中应参照硬件设计文档，确保ID的正确性和有效性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">Range: 0..number of configured controllers of all CAN Driver modules</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00647</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>255</MAX>
                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                      </PARAMETERS>
                      <REFERENCES>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:04062985-d3bb-4998-9129-485e796c0950">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanIfCtrlCanCtrlRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This parameter references to the logical handle of the underlying CAN controller from the CAN Driver module to be served by the CAN Interface module. The following parameters of CanController config container shall be referenced by this link: CanControllerId, CanWakeupSourceRef</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfCtrlCanCtrlRef 是一个配置参数，用于将CAN接口控制器（CanIfCtrl）与底层的CAN控制器（CanCtrl）关联起来，确保CAN接口层能够正确地访问和控制物理CAN控制器。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需要确保每个CanIfCtrl唯一地引用一个CanCtrl；引用的CanCtrl必须在系统中存在且已配置；如果系统中有多个CAN控制器，需要为每个控制器配置一个对应的CanIfCtrlCanCtrlRef。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">Range: 0..max. number of underlying supported CAN controllers</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00636</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Can/CanConfigSet/CanController</DESTINATION-REF>
                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:04062985-d3bb-4998-9129-485e796c0950">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanIfCtrlCoreRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This parameter references to OsPhysicalCore, indicating the core information of the CAN Controller </L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">CanIfCtrlCoreRef 配置项定义了CANIF控制器通道关联的核信息。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanIfCtrlCoreRef时，需要确保已配置EcuC/EcucHardware/EcucCoreDefinition。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">Range: 0..max. number of underlying supported OsPhysicalCore</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00636</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/EcuC/EcucHardware/EcucCoreDefinition</DESTINATION-REF>
                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                      </REFERENCES>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                  </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:da4c74dd-cfdf-43a2-94c4-a32a24264e54">
                  <SHORT-NAME>CanIfDispatchCfg</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">Callback functions provided by upper layer modules of the CanIf. The callback functions defined in this container are common to all configured CAN Driver / CAN Transceiver Driver modules.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfDispatchCfg 是 CAN 接口模块的配置参数之一，用于定义CAN控制器的中断和轮询机制，以及相关的回调函数。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanIfDispatchCfg时，需要确保中断和轮询机制与硬件和操作系统的能力相匹配；正确配置回调函数，以便在接收到CAN消息或发生状态变化时能够执行相应的动作；在多CAN控制器系统中，每个控制器的CanIfDispatchCfg配置必须是唯一的，以避免冲突。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00250</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <PARAMETERS>
                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:0bbaf0c7-4bc2-4004-add9-2e41e44b0cb3">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanIfDispatchUserCheckTrcvWakeFlagIndicationUL</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines the upper layer module to which the CheckTrcvWakeFlagIndication from the Driver modules have to be routed.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfDispatchUserCheckTrcvWakeFlagIndicationUL配置项用于定义用户层（UL）检查传输层唤醒标志指示的调度策略，确保在接收到唤醒标志时能够正确地通知上层用户。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项需要与系统中的唤醒管理策略相匹配，确保唤醒事件能够被正确处理；在配置时需注意选择合适的用户层服务以响应唤醒标志；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对唤醒管理有详细定义，需确保配置与标准一致。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">If CanIfPublicPnSupport equals False, this parameter shall not be configurable.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00792</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <LITERALS>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:b62b7803-b84f-89f7-44d1-ebb7ca9c05a1">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CAN_SM</SHORT-NAME>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:cc72d3b8-839a-9341-2e7d-a76884aeaf44">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CDD</SHORT-NAME>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                      </LITERALS>
                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:9547aae5-127b-4d0d-90a2-3ba8a27fcd9c">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanIfDispatchUserClearTrcvWufFlagIndicationUL</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines the upper layer module to which the ClearTrcvWufFlagIndication from the Driver modules have to be routed.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfDispatchUserClearTrcvWufFlagIndicationUL 是一个配置参数，用于指定当CAN转换器（Transceiver）唤醒标志被清除时，哪个上层用户（Upper Layer User）将被通知。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置此参数时，需要确保指定的上层用户具有处理唤醒标志清除指示的功能；此配置项应与系统中实际使用的CAN转换器和网络管理逻辑相匹配；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保此配置项的数据类型和使用方式符合规范要求。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">If CanIfPublicPnSupport equals False, this parameter shall not be configurable.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00790</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
