                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:e3ad75a1-387d-4959-a130-dbefbe31f022">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanIfDispatchUserConfirmPnAvailabilityUL</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines the upper layer module to which the ConfirmPnAvailability notification from the Driver modules have to be routed. If CanIfPublicPnSupport equals False, this parameter shall not be configurable.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfDispatchUserConfirmPnAvailabilityUL 是用于配置CAN接口模块，当接收到特定网络请求时，通知上层用户（User Layer）的可用性确认。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保该配置与上层用户的实际需求相匹配；在配置时需注意选择正确的用户层协议处理模块；此配置项应与整体网络管理策略一致，避免配置错误导致网络管理功能异常。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00820</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
