                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:59b203fd-969e-44cd-afab-698d689e3bcf">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanIfDispatchUserValidateWakeupEventUL</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines the upper layer (UL) module to which the notifications about positive former requested wake up sources have to be routed via &lt;User_ValidateWakeupEvent&gt;.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfDispatchUserValidateWakeupEventUL 配置项用于定义用户验证唤醒事件的上层模块(User Layer)的标识符，这允许CAN接口模块(CAN Interface module)将唤醒事件通知给相应的上层模块。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanIfDispatchUserValidateWakeupEventUL时，需要确保所指定的上层模块已经实现了唤醒事件的验证机制；此配置项应与系统中实际使用的唤醒源和上层模块保持一致；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应当遵循模块间通信接口的规范来配置此项。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00549</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
