                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                        <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-CONDITIONAL/>
                      </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                    </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF>
                    <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF UUID="ECUC:b0e98d0b-7b7f-42d7-accc-d19c2e52d62d">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanIfDispatchUserClearTrcvWufFlagIndicationName</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines the name of &lt;User_ClearTrcvWufFlagIndication&gt;.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfDispatchUserClearTrcvWufFlagIndicationName 配置项用于指定当CAN转换器唤醒标志被清除时，由CAN接口模块调用的用户回调函数的名称。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：用户需要确保配置的回调函数名称在系统中是唯一的，并且与实际实现的回调函数名称相匹配；此配置项通常与特定的CAN转换器硬件和驱动有关，因此需要根据硬件的实际情况进行配置；在配置此项时，应参考硬件手册和驱动程序文档，以确保正确的集成和功能行为。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">If CanIfDispatchUserClearTrcvWufFlagIndicationUL equals CAN_SM the name of &lt;User_ClearTrcvWufFlagIndication&gt; is fixed. If it equals CDD, the name is selectable. If CanIfPublicPnSupport equals False, this parameter shall not be configurable.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00789</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
