                    <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF UUID="ECUC:52c27ccd-402a-494b-bd19-307b4fe68bc7">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanIfDispatchUserCtrlBusOffName</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines the name of &lt;User_ControllerBusOff&gt;.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfDispatchUserCtrlBusOffName配置项用于指定在CAN接口发生总线关闭（Bus Off）事件时，应当调用的用户控制器的回调函数名称。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保指定的回调函数遵循AUTOSAR标准中定义的原型和行为要求；在配置时，需要确保该回调函数已在系统中定义且可被正确调用；此配置项对于实现CAN通信的错误处理和恢复机制至关重要。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">This parameter depends on the parameter CanIfDispatchUserCtrlBusOffUL. If CanIfDispatchUserCtrlBusOffUL equals CAN_SM the name of &lt;User_ControllerBusOff&gt; is fixed. If CanIfDispatchUserCtrlBusOffUL equals CDD, the name of &lt;User_ControllerBusOff&gt; is selectable.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00525</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
