                    <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF UUID="ECUC:163858a2-5ab3-4b1e-979e-789380918c8d">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanIfDispatchUserCtrlModeIndicationName</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines the name of &lt;User_ControllerModeIndication&gt;.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfDispatchUserCtrlModeIndicationName 是一个配置参数，用于指定控制器模式指示（Controller Mode Indication）的用户函数名称，该函数在CAN接口模块检测到CAN控制器模式变化时被调用。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项的名称应与实际实现的用户函数名称一致；用户函数需要遵循AUTOSAR规范中定义的接口和参数列表；确保在整个项目中该名称的唯一性，避免命名冲突。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">This parameter depends on the parameter CanIfDispatchUserCtrlModeIndicationUL. If CanIfDispatchUserCtrlModeIndicationUL equals CAN_SM the name of &lt;User_ControllerModeIndication&gt; is fixed. If CanIfDispatchUserCtrlModeIndicationUL equals CDD, the name of &lt;User_ControllerModeIndication&gt; is selectable.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00683</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
