                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:5f4506a5-be5f-497c-9349-d69427ba9d24">
                  <SHORT-NAME>CanIfInitCfg</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the init parameters of the CAN Interface.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfInitCfg 是CAN接口模块的初始化配置，它定义了CAN接口在系统启动时的配置参数，包括控制器引用、硬件对象配置以及相关的回调函数。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanIfInitCfg时，需要确保引用的CAN控制器和硬件对象与实际硬件和ECU的CAN网络结构相匹配；初始化参数必须与CAN控制器的能力和系统需求一致；在配置过程中，应遵循AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对初始化配置的具体要求和限制。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00247</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <PARAMETERS>
                  </PARAMETERS>
                  <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:2541ff9b-ca8a-4388-b3e9-4e893a369d4e">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanIfBufferCfg</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the Txbuffer configuration. Multiple buffers with different sizes could be configured. If CanIfBufferSize (ECUC_CanIf_00834) equals 0, the CanIf Tx L-PDU only refers via this CanIfBufferCfg the corresponding CanIfHthCfg.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfBufferCfg 是用于配置CAN接口模块中的缓冲区，这些缓冲区用于存储发送或接收的CAN消息，直到它们被处理。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanIfBufferCfg时，需确保缓冲区大小与消息处理速率相匹配，避免溢出；缓冲区的配置应支持系统的通信需求，并考虑优先级和消息ID的过滤；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准可能对缓冲区的类型和数量有特定的限制或要求，需要遵守这些规范。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00832</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:3e890c54-df3d-4d91-bee8-0f6ee7a81053">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanIfBufferSize</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines the number of CanIf Tx L-PDUs which can be buffered in one Txbuffer. If this value equals 0, the CanIf does not perform Txbuffering for the CanIf Tx L-PDUs which are assigned to this Txbuffer. If CanIfPublicTxBuffering equals False, this parameter equals 0 for all TxBuffer. If the CanHandleType of the referred HTH equals FULL, this parameter equals 0 for this TxBuffer.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfBufferSize配置项定义了CAN接口模块中每个硬件对象（如发送或接收缓冲区）的缓冲区大小，用于存储CAN帧，直到它们被处理。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanIfBufferSize时，需要确保缓冲区大小足以容纳高峰期间的数据流量，避免数据丢失；此配置项的设置应考虑系统的内存资源限制；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中并未明确指定缓冲区大小的具体值，需要根据实际应用需求和硬件能力来确定。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00834</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>0</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                          <MAX>255</MAX>
                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                      </PARAMETERS>
                      <REFERENCES>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:fb6c787d-41aa-4920-8680-030a0a2e8bc2">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanIfBufferHthRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Reference to HTH, that defines the hardware object or the pool of hardware objects configured for transmission. All the CanIf Tx L-PDUs refer via the CanIfBufferCfg and this parameter to the HTHs if TxBuffering is enabled, or not.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfBufferHthRef 配置项是用于定义硬件传输句柄（Hardware Transmit Handle, HTH）与特定的CAN接口发送缓冲区之间的关联。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanIfBufferHthRef时，必须确保引用的HTH是存在的并且与所配置的CAN控制器相匹配；HTH的唯一性要保证，以避免在发送过程中的冲突；在配置时还应考虑到HTH的负载平衡，以优化网络的带宽利用率。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">Each HTH shall not be assigned to more than one buffer.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00833</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/CanIf/CanIfInitCfg/CanIfInitHohCfg/CanIfHthCfg</DESTINATION-REF>
                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                      </REFERENCES>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:c2f0d182-e8ee-4d61-8286-d2eeadc94428">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanIfInitHohCfg</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the references to the configuration setup of each underlying CAN Driver.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfInitHohCfg 是一个配置参数，用于初始化CAN接口的硬件对象句柄（HOH），它定义了CAN控制器与CAN网络之间的映射关系。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanIfInitHohCfg时，需要确保硬件对象句柄与实际的CAN控制器和网络节点正确对应；此外，每个HOH应该是唯一的，不应与其他HOH冲突；根据AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准，还需要考虑HOH的类型（如发送或接收）和相关的CAN ID过滤设置。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00257</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:a98b1f9b-0224-4f3b-80fc-49dc63340626">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanIfHrhCfg</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container contains configuration parameters for each hardware receive object (HRH).</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfHrhCfg配置项定义了CAN接口硬件接收句柄（HRH）的属性，包括接收对象的标识符类型（标准/扩展）和过滤机制等，用于接收CAN帧。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保每个HRH的配置与实际硬件资源和CAN网络设计相匹配；在配置标识符过滤时，考虑网络上的消息流量和处理能力，以优化性能；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准要求支持多种消息标识符类型，包括标准ID和扩展ID，需正确配置以保证网络兼容性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00259</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:60990db4-406e-4792-9c8f-82ebf55557e6">
                              <SHORT-NAME>CanIfHrhSoftwareFilter</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Selects the hardware receive objects by using the HRH range/list from CAN Driver configuration to define, for which HRH a software filtering has to be performed at during receive processing.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfHrhSoftwareFilter配置项用于定义是否在软件层面上对接收到的CAN消息进行过滤，以决定哪些消息将被上层应用处理。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在使用CanIfHrhSoftwareFilter时，需要确保硬件过滤器的配置与软件过滤器的配置相协调，以避免消息丢失或不必要的处理；此配置项对于系统资源和性能优化至关重要，应根据实际应用需求谨慎配置；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，软件过滤的实现细节可能会根据具体的MCAL驱动和ECU硬件特性有所不同。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">True: Software filtering is enabled
                                                        False: Software filtering is enabled</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00632</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DEFAULT-VALUE>true</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                            </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                          </PARAMETERS>
                          <REFERENCES>
                            <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:624b2048-16ec-4408-85dc-a82a5c93e09c">
                              <SHORT-NAME>CanIfHrhCanCtrlIdRef</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Reference to controller Id to which the HRH belongs to. A controller can contain one or more HRHs.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfHrhCanCtrlIdRef是一个配置项，用于将硬件接收句柄（HRH）与特定的CAN控制器标识符关联起来，确保接收到的CAN消息能够被正确地分配到指定的CAN控制器处理。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保每个HRH正确地映射到一个存在的CAN控制器ID上；不正确的映射可能导致消息处理错误；在多CAN控制器系统中，此配置尤为重要以保证消息的正确路由。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00631</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/CanIf/CanIfCtrlDrvCfg/CanIfCtrlCfg</DESTINATION-REF>
                            </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                            <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:1fbf0d02-5160-4182-b3bd-488d490d9c7a">
                              <SHORT-NAME>CanIfHrhIdSymRef</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">The parameter refers to a particular HRH object in the CanDrv configuration (see CanHardwareObject ECUC_Can_00324).</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfHrhIdSymRef 是一个配置参数，用于将硬件接收句柄（Hardware Receive Handle, HRH）与符号引用（Symbolic Reference）关联起来，这样就可以通过符号名称引用特定的CAN接口接收句柄。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时，确保每个HRH的符号引用是唯一的，以避免在系统中产生歧义；符号引用应与系统中使用的CAN消息标识符保持一致，以确保正确的消息处理；在配置过程中，应参照AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中的相关规范来正确设置此参数。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">CanIf receives the following information of the CanDrv module by this reference:
                                                        - CanHandleType (see ECUC_Can_00323)
                                                        - CanObjectId (see ECUC_Can_00326)</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00634</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Can/CanConfigSet/CanHardwareObject</DESTINATION-REF>
                            </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                          </REFERENCES>
                          <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                            <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:ea579804-c8f4-484d-a3e7-da6a2b2e8e20">
                              <SHORT-NAME>CanIfHrhRangeCfg</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Defines the parameters required for configurating multiple CANID ranges for a given same HRH.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfHrhRangeCfg 是一个配置参数，用于定义CAN接口硬件接收句柄（HRH）的接收范围，这通常涉及到接收ID的上下限，用于过滤接收到的CAN消息。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanIfHrhRangeCfg时，需要确保ID范围与实际的CAN网络消息设计相匹配；此外，要注意ID范围设置不应与其他HRH的设置冲突，以避免消息处理的不确定性；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保配置项符合规范的定义和约束。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <ADMIN-DATA>
                                <SDGS>
                                  <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                    <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                  </SDG>
                                </SDGS>
                              </ADMIN-DATA>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00628</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                              <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <PARAMETERS>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:f99a4757-23c0-42fe-b751-733ccac9dc93">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>CanIfHrhRangeRxPduRangeCanIdType</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Specifies whether a configured Range of CAN Ids shall only consider standard CAN Ids or extended CAN Ids.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfHrhRangeRxPduRangeCanIdType 配置项用于定义接收的CAN帧标识符的类型，这通常是标准的11位标识符或是扩展的29位标识符，用于硬件接收处理器（HRH）的接收PDU范围过滤。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需要确保CAN标识符类型与实际使用的CAN ID类型相匹配；如果配置了错误的类型，可能会导致接收处理器无法正确过滤接收到的消息；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，该配置项应与CAN驱动和CAN控制器的能力相一致。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00644</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <LITERALS>
                                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:b125ff83-7754-9364-555a-1475fe2d0b14">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>EXTENDED</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:8cb1bb42-1706-9525-3852-eb7cee1f12a2">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>STANDARD</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                  </LITERALS>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                                <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:43486ba9-1998-4811-a755-7e8204346a89">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>CanIfHrhRangeBaseId</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">CAN Identifier used as base value in combination with CanIfHrhRangeMask for a masked ID range in which all CAN Ids shall pass the software filtering. The size of this parameter is limited by CanIfHrhRangeRxPduRangeCanIdType.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfHrhRangeBaseId 用于定义接收硬件资源（HRH）的基础标识符，用于区分不同的消息范围。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保CanIfHrhRangeBaseId与系统中其他HRH的标识符不冲突；在配置时考虑消息标识符的范围和过滤需求；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，该配置项应正确映射到相应的CAN控制器和消息缓冲区。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00825</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                  <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
