                                  <MIN>0</MIN>
                                </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                                <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:c89cc359-e688-45ea-b1cf-23f99ff1fb7c">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>CanIfHrhRangeMask</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Used as mask value in combination with CanIfHrhRangeBaseId for a masked ID range in which all CAN Ids shall pass the software filtering. The size of this parameter is limited by CanIfHrhRangeRxPduRangeCanIdType.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfHrhRangeMask 用于定义接收硬件资源（HRH）的标识符范围掩码，用于过滤接收到的CAN消息，确保只处理符合特定标识符范围的消息。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保CanIfHrhRangeMask与HRH的配置匹配，以正确过滤消息；掩码设置应遵循CAN标准的标识符规范；在配置时需考虑消息标识符的扩展和标准格式。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00826</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                  <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
