                                  <MIN>0</MIN>
                                </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                              </PARAMETERS>
                            </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                          </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:5e0633ce-3473-4f6e-b7d5-51210b9247ae">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanIfHthCfg</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container contains parameters related to each HTH.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfHthCfg 是一个配置参数，用于定义硬件传输句柄（Hardware Transmit Handle, HTH）的属性，这些属性包括用于发送CAN帧的硬件对象和相关的CAN控制器。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanIfHthCfg时，需要确保每个HTH的ID是唯一的，并且与实际的硬件资源相匹配；HTH配置必须与CAN控制器和CAN驱动的配置保持一致；在配置HTH时，还应考虑消息的优先级和发送策略，以确保消息传输的效率和可靠性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00258</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <REFERENCES>
                            <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:698f1110-fa03-4dd0-9eb2-035e074c3e3d">
                              <SHORT-NAME>CanIfHthCanCtrlIdRef</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Reference to controller Id to which the HTH belongs to. A controller can contain one or more HTHs.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfHthCanCtrlIdRef是一个配置项，用于将硬件传输句柄（Hardware Transmit Handle, HTH）映射到特定的CAN控制器ID，确保消息的发送通过正确的CAN控制器进行。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保每个HTH正确地映射到一个存在的CAN控制器ID上；不同的HTH应避免映射到同一个CAN控制器ID，除非特定的应用场景需要这样做；在多CAN控制器系统中，正确的映射对于消息的准确发送和系统的稳定性至关重要。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00625</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/CanIf/CanIfCtrlDrvCfg/CanIfCtrlCfg</DESTINATION-REF>
                            </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                            <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:993e2b0d-53d4-43e5-9ef8-3dffe7bcd33b">
                              <SHORT-NAME>CanIfHthIdSymRef</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">The parameter refers to a particular HTH object in the CanDrv configuration (see CanHardwareObject ECUC_Can_00324).</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfHthIdSymRef是一个配置项，用于将硬件传输句柄（Hardware Transmit Handle, HTH）与符号引用（Symbolic Reference）关联起来，以便在发送CAN帧时引用特定的硬件资源。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanIfHthIdSymRef时，必须确保引用的HTH与CAN控制器和物理通道正确匹配；该配置项对于确保CAN接口层正确管理CAN帧的发送至关重要；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保该配置项的正确性对于系统的通信可靠性和性能有直接影响。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">CanIf receives the following information of the CanDrv module by this reference:
                                                        - CanHandleType (see ECUC_Can_00323)
                                                        - CanObjectId (see ECUC_Can_00326)</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00627</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Can/CanConfigSet/CanHardwareObject</DESTINATION-REF>
                            </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                          </REFERENCES>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                      </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:35904777-ce11-4a2b-afb3-88cc26d0aff8">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanIfRxPduCfg</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) of each receive CAN L-PDU.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfRxPduCfg配置项定义了接收CAN帧的参数，包括PDU的ID、数据长度、接收处理函数等，用于指定如何处理接收到的CAN消息。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保每个CanIfRxPduCfg配置的PDU ID在系统中是唯一的，避免消息处理冲突；配置的数据长度应与实际CAN帧数据长度匹配，以确保正确解析数据；接收处理函数需要根据实际应用需求进行配置，确保消息能被正确处理。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">The SHORT-NAME of &quot;CanIfRxPduConfig&quot; container itself represents the symolic name of Receive L-PDU.

                                        This L-SDU produces a meta data item of type CAN_ID_32.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00249</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:1de801f9-576a-4ac9-8d84-54b3db028c95">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanIfRxPduDataLengthCheck</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This parameter switches the message specific data length check.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfRxPduDataLengthCheck 配置项用于定义是否对接收到的CAN接口协议数据单元（PDU）的长度进行检查，以确保数据的完整性和正确性。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，确保该配置项正确设置以防止数据长度错误导致的通信问题；长度检查有助于提前识别和处理可能的数据错误；不正确的数据长度设置可能会导致系统行为不符合预期。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">True: Data length check will be executed during the reception of this PDU.
                                                False: No data length check will be executed during the reception of this PDU.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00846</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:b4e0eaf5-d039-4538-bb85-03228bf7a612">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanIfRxPduCanIdType</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">CAN Identifier of receive CAN L-PDUs used by the CAN Driver for CAN L-PDU reception.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfRxPduCanIdType配置项用于定义接收的PDU（协议数据单元）的CAN ID类型，这决定了CAN ID是标准帧格式还是扩展帧格式。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanIfRxPduCanIdType时，必须确保所选类型与网络上实际传输的CAN帧类型一致；错误的配置可能导致接收机制无法正确识别CAN帧；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准支持的类型包括标准、扩展和混合模式。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00596</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
