                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                            <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-CONDITIONAL/>
                          </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                        </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:2db03b9b-a549-4a9e-bf76-578d1cf85678">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanIfRxPduCanId</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">CAN Identifier of Receive CAN L-PDUs used by the CAN Interface. Exa: Software Filtering. This parameter is used if exactly one Can Identifier is assigned to the Pdu. If a range is assigned then the CanIfRxPduCanIdRange parameter shall be used.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfRxPduCanId是一个配置项，用于定义CAN接口模块中接收的PDU（协议数据单元）的CAN标识符，这个标识符用于识别网络上的不同消息。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanIfRxPduCanId时，需要确保CAN ID与网络上其他消息的ID不冲突；根据CAN网络的要求，选择标准ID（11位）或扩展ID（29位）；在配置过程中，还需考虑消息的优先级，因为CAN ID的值会影响到消息在网络中的传输优先级。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">Range: 11 Bit For Standard CAN Identifier ... 29 Bit For Extended CAN identifier</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00598</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>536870911</MAX>
                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:50131755-ddcd-45ca-bba4-e8fc8a8d3c73">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanIfRxPduCanIdMask</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Identifier mask which denotes relevant bits in the CAN Identifier. This parameter defines a CAN Identifier range in an alternative way to CanIfRxPduCanIdRange. It identifies the bits of the configured CAN Identifier that must match the received CAN Identifier. Range: 11 bits for Standard CAN Identifier, 29 bits for Extended CAN Identifier.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfRxPduCanIdMask用于定义接收的CAN帧的CAN ID掩码，以便过滤和识别特定的CAN消息。这允许软件根据CAN ID的特定位模式接收消息，增加了灵活性和筛选能力。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanIfRxPduCanIdMask时，需要确保掩码与对应的CanIfRxPduCanId设置相匹配，以正确过滤所需的消息；掩码值的设置应考虑到实际应用中可能存在的ID变化范围；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对于CAN ID掩码的使用有明确规范，需要遵循这些规范以保证兼容性。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00822</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>536870911</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                          <MAX>536870911</MAX>
                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:53e64697-6612-4c0c-80f4-25f5a9bd40d7">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanIfRxPduDataLength</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Data length of the received CAN L-PDUs used by the CAN Interface.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfRxPduDataLength 定义了接收到的CAN接口协议数据单元（PDU）的数据长度。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：数据长度应符合CAN网络的标准和配置要求；长度配置错误可能导致数据处理异常；确保与发送端的PDU长度匹配以保证数据的正确接收和处理。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">This information is used for Data Length Check. Additionally it might specify the valid bits in case of the discrete DLC for CAN FD L-PDUs &gt; 8 bytes.

                                                The data area size of a CAN L-PDU can have a range from 0 to 64 bytes.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00599</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>64</MAX>
                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:c80d7823-4185-4880-b74b-37aa9539864c">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanIfRxPduId</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">ECU wide unique, symbolic handle for receive CAN L-SDU. It shall fulfill ANSI/AUTOSAR definitions for constant defines.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfRxPduId 是用于标识接收到的CAN协议数据单元（PDU）的唯一标识符。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保每个CanIfRxPduId在系统中是唯一的，以避免数据处理上的混淆；该标识符应与ECU内部处理和诊断功能的配置相匹配；在配置过程中，应考虑PDU的优先级和处理策略。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">Range: 0..max. number of defined CanRxPduIds</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00597</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>4294967295</MAX>
                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                      </PARAMETERS>
                      <REFERENCES>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:a7fc2ca7-7ef3-4285-b179-359afe3ea369">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanIfRxPduHrhIdRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">The HRH to which Rx L-PDU belongs to, is referred through this parameter.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfRxPduHrhIdRef 是一个配置参数，用于将接收的CAN接口协议数据单元（PDU）与硬件接收处理句柄（HRH）关联起来，确保正确的数据流向和处理。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保每个CanIfRxPduHrhIdRef正确指向一个存在的HRH；HRH的配置应与实际的CAN控制器和消息缓冲区相匹配；不正确的关联可能导致接收消息处理失败或数据流向错误。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00602</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/CanIf/CanIfInitCfg/CanIfInitHohCfg/CanIfHrhCfg</DESTINATION-REF>
                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:6ec97ca8-68cc-4aee-8f58-0955fd67cce5">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanIfRxPduRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Reference to the &quot;global&quot; Pdu structure to allow harmonization of handle IDs in the COM-Stack.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfRxPduRef 是一个配置参数，用于引用接收到的CAN接口协议数据单元（PDU）。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保每个CanIfRxPduRef正确映射到相应的CAN接口PDU，以保证数据的正确接收和处理；在配置时需遵循AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对PDU引用的具体要求；不正确的PDU引用可能导致数据处理错误或系统功能异常。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00601</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/EcuC/EcucConfigSet/EcucPduCollection/Pdu</DESTINATION-REF>
                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                      </REFERENCES>
                      <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:4e391be4-9fc9-4eb0-9446-4c26dc19d1a5">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanIfRxPduCanIdRange</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Optional container that allows to map a range of CAN Ids to one PduId.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfRxPduCanIdRange 配置项用于定义接收的CAN消息标识符（CAN ID）的范围，这样CAN接口（CanIf）模块可以接收一系列的CAN ID，而不是单个ID。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanIfRxPduCanIdRange时，需要确保所定义的CAN ID范围不与其他接收或发送的CAN ID冲突；范围的上下限应该符合CAN标准中ID的有效值；在配置ID范围时，还应考虑到消息过滤的硬件支持能力，以确保系统能够有效处理所接收的消息。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00743</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:c2e0f2db-8884-48ad-b435-c415923641fb">
                              <SHORT-NAME>CanIfRxPduCanIdRangeLowerCanId</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Lower CAN Identifier of a receive CAN L-PDU for identifier range definition, in which all CAN Ids are mapped to one PduId.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfRxPduCanIdRangeLowerCanId 是用于定义接收的CAN帧的CAN标识符（CAN ID）的下限，这是为了支持接收ID范围内的所有消息，而不是单个ID的消息。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项通常与CanIfRxPduCanIdRangeUpperCanId一起使用，以定义接收ID的范围；确保定义的范围不与其他接收或发送的CAN ID冲突；在配置ID范围时，要注意CAN控制器的过滤能力，以确保硬件能够正确处理所配置的ID范围。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00745</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <MAX>536870911</MAX>
                              <MIN>0</MIN>
                            </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:0add622f-4049-4d75-80a6-d49bbef3c636">
                              <SHORT-NAME>CanIfRxPduCanIdRangeUpperCanId</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Upper CAN Identifier of a receive CAN L-PDU for identifier range definition, in which all CAN Ids are mapped to one PduId.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfRxPduCanIdRangeUpperCanId 是一个配置项，用于定义接收的CAN帧的CAN标识符（CAN ID）的上限范围，这样CAN接口（CanIf）模块可以接收在指定范围内的所有CAN帧。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保CanIfRxPduCanIdRangeUpperCanId的值高于或等于对应CanIfRxPduCanIdRangeLowerCanId值；该配置项通常与CanIfRxPduCanIdRangeLowerCanId一起使用，以定义一个有效的CAN ID范围；在配置CAN ID范围时，考虑到实际的网络通信需求和可能的ID冲突。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00744</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <MAX>536870911</MAX>
                              <MIN>0</MIN>
                            </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                          </PARAMETERS>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:ff49ad92-d7b2-4951-85f0-3a14bea08dc9">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanIfTTRxFrameTriggering</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">CanIfTTRxFrameTriggering is specified in the SWS TTCAN Interface and defines Frame trigger for TTCAN reception.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfTTRxFrameTriggering配置项用于定义CAN接口的时间触发接收帧的属性，这包括接收帧的标识符、数据长度代码（DLC）和引用的硬件对象等信息。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanIfTTRxFrameTriggering时，需要确保引用的硬件对象与CAN控制器和CAN驱动配置一致；此外，时间触发通信（TTCAN）的使用必须符合网络的时间同步要求；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中可能有特定的属性和参数要求，需要根据标准文档进行准确配置。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">This container is only included and valid if TTCAN is supported by the controller, enabled (see CanIfSupportTTCAN, ECUC_CanIf_00675), and a joblist is used for reception.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00003</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:6c211a8b-18cf-41b5-849d-67f232ff137d">
                              <SHORT-NAME>CanTTRxJoblistTimeMark</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Defines the point in time, when the joblist execution funciton (JLEF) shall be called for the referenced rx trigger. Value is given in cycle time. This parameter is only configurable if a joblist is enabled by parameter CanIfTTJobList.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanTTRxJoblistTimeMark 配置项用于定义CAN传输层接收作业列表的时间标记，这有助于在确定的时间点同步处理接收到的消息。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanTTRxJoblistTimeMark时，需要确保时间标记与系统的时间基准同步；此配置项通常与CAN时间触发通信相关，因此需要特别注意与CAN时间触发模块的兼容性；在配置时，还需考虑到消息的接收窗口和系统的时间分辨率，以确保消息能够被正确地按照时间标记处理。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00136</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <MAX>65535</MAX>
                              <MIN>0</MIN>
                            </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                          </PARAMETERS>
                          <REFERENCES>
                            <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:f7d39f69-3d75-4b01-95b9-6ff94ab8450f">
                              <SHORT-NAME>CanIfTTRxHwObjectTriggerIdRef</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This parameter refers to a particular TTCAN hardware receive object Trigger of a hardware object in the TTCAN Driver Module,  which is referred via plain CAN parameter CANIF_HRH_HANDLETYPE_REF. This parameter is only configurable if a joblist is enabled by parameter CanIfTTJobList.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfTTRxHwObjectTriggerIdRef 是一个配置参数，用于引用CAN接口模块中的硬件对象，该硬件对象用于触发部分网络的时间触发接收操作。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanIfTTRxHwObjectTriggerIdRef时，必须确保引用的硬件对象支持时间触发的接收功能；此配置项通常与CAN部分网络的时间同步和时间触发通信机制相关联；在配置时应参考具体的CAN控制器硬件特性和网络管理需求，以确保正确的时间触发行为。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00133</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Can/CanConfigSet/CanHardwareObject/CanTTHardwareObjectTrigger</DESTINATION-REF>
                            </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                          </REFERENCES>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                      </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:fbae4c0d-ab4e-4c56-b9c6-e9c0f26634a9">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanIfTxPduCfg</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) of a transmit CAN L-PDU. It has to be configured as often as a transmit CAN L-PDU is needed.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfTxPduCfg 是一个配置参数，用于定义CAN接口层的传输协议数据单元（PDU）的属性，这些属性包括PDU的标识符、DLC、CAN ID类型等，以便正确地管理CAN消息的发送。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanIfTxPduCfg时，必须确保CAN ID与系统中其他PDU的ID不冲突；还需注意PDU的DLC值是否符合实际的数据长度要求；此外，根据AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准，还应确保配置与PDU的类型和用途相匹配，例如是否支持动态长度等。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">The SHORT-NAME of &quot;CanIfTxPduConfig&quot; container represents the symolic name of Transmit L-PDU.

                                        This L-SDU consumes a meta data item of type CAN_ID_32.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00248</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:8337463d-2539-45a5-9a20-c81e10305546">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanIfTxPduPnFilterPdu</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">If CanIfPublicPnFilterSupport is enabled, by this parameter PDUs could be configured which will pass the CanIfPnFilter.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfTxPduPnFilterPdu配置项用于定义是否对特定的CAN传输协议数据单元（PDU）应用部分网络（PN）过滤，这是为了支持部分网络功能，减少网络唤醒和通信负载。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在使用此配置项时，需要确保车辆网络配置支持部分网络功能；此配置项的使用可能会影响网络唤醒策略，因此需要仔细规划；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，对于部分网络的支持和配置有明确的规范，需要确保配置与标准一致。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">If there is no CanIfTxPduPnFilterPdu configured per controller, the corresponding controller applies no CanIfPnFilter.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00773</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:72a33032-3f7d-4524-9650-fc37d465decd">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanIfTxPduCanIdType</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Type of CAN Identifier of the transmit CAN L-PDU used by the CAN Driver module for CAN L-PDU transmission.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfTxPduCanIdType 是一个配置项，用于定义CAN接口层传输PDU的CAN标识符类型，它决定了CAN ID是标准帧格式（11位）还是扩展帧格式（29位）。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanIfTxPduCanIdType时，需要确保它与实际的CAN网络设计一致；此外，不同的CAN控制器可能对CAN ID类型的支持有所不同，需要根据硬件能力进行配置；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，该配置项应与PDU的CAN ID长度相匹配，否则可能导致通信错误。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00590</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <LITERALS>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:e5b730f6-9363-8e6d-450a-fb38efd286f2">
                              <SHORT-NAME>EXTENDED_CAN</SHORT-NAME>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:2356035b-50a2-9b26-622d-9e0b5887c55a">
                              <SHORT-NAME>EXTENDED_FD_CAN</SHORT-NAME>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:13071845-a09a-8e36-71f4-9fee49fd5f30">
                              <SHORT-NAME>STANDARD_CAN</SHORT-NAME>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:77ba1e85-bc21-8d8f-5522-e6741f58fa76">
                              <SHORT-NAME>STANDARD_FD_CAN</SHORT-NAME>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                          </LITERALS>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:9bee54f7-968d-4c20-98c6-cc78191209bd">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanIfTxPduType</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Defines the type of each transmit CAN L-PDU.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfTxPduType 是一个配置参数，用于定义CAN接口层中传输PDU（协议数据单元）的类型，这决定了PDU如何被处理和传输。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanIfTxPduType时，需要确保它与PDU的实际用途相匹配，例如静态或动态PDU；此外，该配置项应与CAN驱动层和上层服务的需求保持一致；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应检查此配置项的属性是否支持新的或已更改的特性，以确保兼容性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00593</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>STATIC</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                          <LITERALS>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:75e8233a-67f3-9aef-6d5d-5acfeddfa3ce">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DYNAMIC</SHORT-NAME>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:2a1b2bf9-714b-90a0-4845-c597c66474ac">
                              <SHORT-NAME>STATIC</SHORT-NAME>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                          </LITERALS>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:5a98eb1e-b9af-441f-9726-b456b2d3c5a0">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanIfTxPduUserTxConfirmationUL</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines the upper layer (UL) module to which the confirmation of the successfully transmitted CanTxPduId has to be routed via the &lt;User_TxConfirmation&gt;.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfTxPduUserTxConfirmationUL配置项定义了CAN接口层（CanIf）传输PDU（协议数据单元）时，用户传输确认上层（Upper Layer）的模块类型，用于指定哪个上层模块将接收传输确认回调。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项需要与实际项目中使用的上层模块类型相匹配，以确保正确的回调机制；不正确的配置可能导致传输确认信息无法正确传递给目标上层模块；在配置时需参考AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对上层模块类型的定义和要求。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">This &lt;User_TxConfirmation&gt; has to be invoked when the confirmation of the configured CanTxPduId will be received by a Tx confirmation event from the CAN Driver module.
                                                If no upper layer (UL) module is configured, no &lt;User_TxConfirmation&gt; has to be called in case of a Tx confirmation event of the CanTxPduId from the CAN Driver module.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00527</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
