                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:16f0cef0-b138-48c6-8afa-e89fbce39eca">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanIfTxPduCanId</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">CAN Identifier of transmit CAN L-PDUs used by the CAN Driver for CAN L-PDU transmission.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfTxPduCanId 是用于定义CAN接口层传输PDU的CAN标识符（CAN ID），它指定了发送PDU时所使用的CAN ID。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：CAN ID的值必须在CAN网络中唯一，以避免冲突；根据CAN标准，标准帧格式的CAN ID为11位，扩展帧格式的CAN ID为29位；在配置时需要注意与CAN控制器和网络管理的兼容性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">Range: 11 Bit For Standard CAN Identifier ... 29 Bit For Extended CAN identifier

                                                The CAN Identifier may be omitted for dynamic transmit L-PDUs.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00592</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>536870911</MAX>
                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:4a46bf4e-58c4-4293-9dc2-4705b93b72a6">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanIfTxPduCanIdMask</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Identifier mask which denotes relevant bits in the CAN Identifier. This parameter may be used to keep parts of the CAN Identifier of dynamic transmit L-PDUs static. Range: 11 bits for Standard CAN Identifier, 29 bits for Extended CAN Identifier.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfTxPduCanIdMask用于定义发送PDU（协议数据单元）的CAN标识符掩码，以便在发送过程中对CAN ID进行过滤或匹配，确保正确的数据传输。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanIfTxPduCanIdMask时，需要确保掩码与对应的CanIfTxPduCanId设置相匹配以免影响数据的正确发送；掩码的设置应遵循CAN网络的通信协议要求；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，该配置项的使用应结合具体的CAN驱动和网络管理需求进行考虑。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00823</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
