                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:c4a7fa6d-bcab-43c7-a46e-db0f7e5e5f8a">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanIfTxPduId</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">ECU wide unique, symbolic handle for transmit CAN L-SDU.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfTxPduId 是用于标识传输协议数据单元（PDU）的唯一标识符，它在CAN接口模块中用于管理和映射发送的CAN消息。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保每个CanIfTxPduId在系统中是唯一的，以避免数据传输的冲突；在配置时应与ECU的CAN驱动和网络管理配置保持一致；在使用AUTOSAR工具链时，通常这些ID由工具自动分配和管理。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">Range: 0..max. number of CantTxPduIds</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00591</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>4294967295</MAX>
                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:53e64697-6612-4c0c-80f4-25f5a9bd40d7">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanIfTxPduDataLength</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Data length of the tx CAN L-PDUs used by the CAN Interface.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfTxPduDataLength配置项用于定义CAN接口层传输的PDU（协议数据单元）的数据长度，即CAN帧的DLC（Data Length Code）。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanIfTxPduDataLength时，需要确保其值不超过CAN帧允许的最大数据长度，通常为8字节（对于标准CAN）或64字节（对于CAN FD）；此外，该值应与PDU实际数据大小相匹配，避免数据截断或填充；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应当遵循相关的PDU到CAN帧映射规则。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">This information is used for Data Length Check. Additionally it might specify the valid bits in case of the discrete DLC for CAN FD L-PDUs &gt; 8 bytes.

                                                The data area size of a CAN L-PDU can have a range from 0 to 64 bytes.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00599</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>64</MAX>
                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                      </PARAMETERS>
                      <REFERENCES>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:22c29721-2347-42d1-9d0f-5fdf9d5afd45">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanIfTxPduBufferRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Configurable reference to a CanIf buffer configuration.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfTxPduBufferRef 是一个配置参数，用于将CAN接口层的传输PDU（协议数据单元）关联到相应的缓冲区，以便在发送过程中存储和管理PDU。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanIfTxPduBufferRef时，必须确保引用的缓冲区已经定义并且适合于PDU的大小和类型；此外，缓冲区管理策略应当与系统的实时性和可靠性要求相匹配；在配置时还应注意PDU到缓冲区的映射是唯一的，避免不同的PDU引用相同的缓冲区。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00831</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/CanIf/CanIfInitCfg/CanIfBufferCfg</DESTINATION-REF>
                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:cf0ea2f5-ea57-4256-a638-2c19b5c65fee">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanIfTxPduRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Reference to the &quot;global&quot; Pdu structure to allow harmonization of handle IDs in the COM-Stack.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfTxPduRef 是一个配置参数，用于将CAN接口层的传输PDU（协议数据单元）引用到具体的CAN驱动层的发送PDU。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanIfTxPduRef时，必须确保引用的CAN驱动层PDU已经定义且与CAN接口层的PDU匹配；此外，确保PDU的ID和类型等属性与实际的CAN网络通信要求一致；在配置过程中，还应注意避免PDU重复引用或者引用错误，以确保CAN通信的正确性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00603</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/EcuC/EcucConfigSet/EcucPduCollection/Pdu</DESTINATION-REF>
                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                      </REFERENCES>
                      <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:4e110edd-0521-4fe3-a213-8e2775651ecd">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanIfTTTxFrameTriggering</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">CanIfTTTxFrameTriggering is specified in the SWS TTCAN Interface and defines Frame trigger for TTCAN transmission.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfTTTxFrameTriggering配置项是用于定义CAN接口的时间触发传输帧的触发属性，这包括了帧的标识符、数据长度代码（DLC）和引用的硬件对象等信息。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保配置的触发属性与系统的时间触发通信需求相匹配；如果系统不支持时间触发通信，则不应配置此项；在配置时，需要注意与CanIfTxPduConfig和CanController的配置保持一致性。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">This container is only included and valid if TTCAN is supported by the controller, enabled (see CanIfSupportTTCAN, ECUC_CanIf_00675), and a joblist is used.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00142</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:a53187d3-37d7-469e-8a18-6bb564ded1bc">
                              <SHORT-NAME>CanIfTTTxJoblistTimeMark</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Defines the point in time, when the joblist execution funciton (JLEF) shall be called for the referenced tx frame trigger.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfTTTxJoblistTimeMark 配置项用于定义在时间触发的CAN通信中，发送任务列表的时间标记，这有助于确保在预定的时间点发送特定的CAN帧。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在使用时间触发的CAN通信时，需要确保时间标记的准确性和一致性；该配置项应与CAN驱动和时间同步机制紧密协作，以保证时间触发传输的可靠性；在配置时需考虑系统的时间分辨率和精度要求，以避免时间偏差导致的通信问题。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">Value is given in cycle time. This parameter is only configurable if a joblist is enabled by parameter CanIfTTJobList.</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00132</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <MAX>65535</MAX>
                              <MIN>0</MIN>
                            </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                          </PARAMETERS>
                          <REFERENCES>
                            <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:e97b8ed4-bfb6-4964-adc0-5dc3f80cd53d">
                              <SHORT-NAME>CanIfTTTxHwObjectTriggerIdRef</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This parameter refers to a particular TTCAN hardware transmit object Trigger of a hardware object in the TTCAN Driver Module,</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfTTTxHwObjectTriggerIdRef是用于引用特定的硬件对象触发器ID，这在基于时间触发的CAN通信帧传输中是必需的，以确保按时发送CAN帧。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：此配置项在使用时间触发传输（TT）功能时才相关；确保引用的触发器ID与实际硬件配置相匹配；在不支持时间触发的硬件上使用此配置可能导致配置错误。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">which is referred via plain CAN parameter CANIF_HTH_HANDLETYPE_REF. This parameter is only configurable if a joblist is enabled by parameter CanIfTTJobList.</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00128</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Can/CanConfigSet/CanHardwareObject/CanTTHardwareObjectTrigger</DESTINATION-REF>
                            </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                          </REFERENCES>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                      </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                  </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:01e44938-bbb9-43e3-aebe-49b1e30f3619">
                  <SHORT-NAME>CanIfPrivateCfg</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the private configuration (parameters) of the CAN Interface.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfPrivateCfg 是一个配置容器，包含了CAN接口模块的私有配置参数，这些参数通常不会被外部模块所访问，用于定义CAN接口模块内部的行为和属性。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanIfPrivateCfg时，需要确保所有的私有参数与项目的具体需求和CAN控制器的特性相匹配；此外，应当遵循AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对于私有配置参数的规定和限制；在进行配置时，还应注意与其他模块的配置参数之间的兼容性和一致性。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00245</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <PARAMETERS>
                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:6cc3af1f-c6f0-4c59-b350-91e27d0e27f9">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanIfPrivateSoftwareFilterType</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Selects the desired software filter mechanism for reception only.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfPrivateSoftwareFilterType 是一个配置参数，用于定义CAN接口模块内部软件消息过滤的类型，以确定哪些接收到的CAN消息将被上层软件处理。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanIfPrivateSoftwareFilterType时，需要确保选择的过滤类型与系统的消息处理策略相匹配；此外，过滤类型的选择可能会影响系统的性能，因为不同的过滤机制可能对CPU的负载有不同的影响；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应当检查该配置项是否支持所有必要的过滤类型，以满足应用需求。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">Each implemented software filtering method is identified by this enumeration number.

                                        Range: Types implemented software filtering methods</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00619</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>LINEAR</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                      <LITERALS>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:d98eb3d2-ca84-86fa-692d-f8d38a4c328c">
                          <SHORT-NAME>BINARY</SHORT-NAME>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:965834c7-6f2b-8587-5d08-6f349e2fc881">
                          <SHORT-NAME>LINEAR</SHORT-NAME>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                      </LITERALS>
                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:9536b5c8-fdf5-47ae-8c8a-d74c2a2a28e6">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanIfPrivateDataLengthCheck</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Selects whether Data Length Check is supported.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfPrivateDataLengthCheck 是用于检查通过CAN接口发送和接收的数据长度是否符合预设标准的配置项，确保数据的完整性和正确性。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置此项时，必须确保设置的数据长度符合相关的CAN网络消息标准；不正确的数据长度设置可能导致数据传输错误或丢失；此配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中应当与具体的CAN驱动和网络管理配置紧密协调。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">True: Enabled
                                        False: Disabled</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00617</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                  </PARAMETERS>
                  <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:21377386-cebf-4969-a0ce-c6ec4ac5a68e">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanIfTTGeneral</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">CanIfTTGeneral is specified in the SWS TTCAN Interface and defines if and in which way TTCAN is supported.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfTTGeneral是AUTOSAR CAN接口模块的配置参数之一，用于定义CAN接口的传输层（Transfer Layer）的一般性配置，如是否启用特定的传输层功能。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanIfTTGeneral时，需要确保所选功能与硬件能力和项目需求相匹配；此配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中可能没有直接对应，因为标准主要定义接口和功能模块的抽象层，具体实现细节可能因供应商而异；务必参考具体的AUTOSAR实现文档和硬件手册以确保正确配置。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">This container is only included and valid if TTCAN is supported by the controller, enabled (see CanIfSupportTTCAN, ECUC_CanIf_00675), and used.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00005</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:e2966695-ae7f-4e4d-8449-32cdc08be5ce">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanIfTTJoblist</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Defines whether TTCAN is processed via a joblist.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfTTJoblist 配置项用于定义CAN接口模块中的触发传输作业列表，这些作业列表指定了在特定条件下需要发送的CAN消息的顺序和时间。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanIfTTJoblist时，需要确保列表中的CAN消息符合网络的时间触发传输要求；此外，要注意与CAN驱动和网络管理模块的兼容性；在配置时还应考虑系统的实时性和消息优先级。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">TRUE: Joblist is used.
                                                FALSE: No joblist is used.

                                                This parameter is only configurable if TTCAN is enabled by parameter CanIfSupportTTCAN.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00126</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:5f0125fa-613b-4f80-bdc3-6f44ea1d156b">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanIfTTMaxIsrDelay</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Defines the maximum delay for the execution of the joblist execution function JLEF. This parameter is only configurable if a joblist is enabled by parameter CanIfTTJobList.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfTTMaxIsrDelay 配置项定义了CAN接口模块中，从接收到中断信号到开始处理该中断的最大延迟时间，这个时间用于确保CAN通信的实时性和可靠性。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该参数的设置需要考虑系统的实时性要求和中断服务例程(ISR)的优先级；过高的延迟时间可能会导致CAN消息处理不及时，影响系统性能；在配置时需要确保与实际硬件和操作系统的中断响应能力相匹配。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00127</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>65535</MAX>
                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                      </PARAMETERS>
                      <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:cd6b252b-0b45-4d71-8242-b28cdc2636b0">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanIfTTDemEventParameterRefs</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Container for the references to DemEventParameter elements which shall be invoked using the API Dem_SetEventStatus in case the corresponding error occurs. The EventId is taken from the referenced DemEventParameter's DemEventId symbolic value. The standardized errors are provided in this container and can be extended by vendor-specific error references.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfTTDemEventParameterRefs配置项用于引用CAN接口模块中传输层错误检测管理（TTDem）事件的参数，允许CAN接口模块报告传输层的错误事件给诊断事件管理器（Dem）。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保引用的Dem事件参数与实际的诊断需求相匹配；在配置时需遵循AUTOSAR的标准数据模型，以确保兼容性；该配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中可能需要根据具体的实现和版本进行适当调整，以确保与最新的诊断管理策略一致。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00835</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <REFERENCES>
                            <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:e864134c-21c9-47e0-b916-81e38277b9e9">
                              <SHORT-NAME>CANIF_TT_E_JLE_SYNC</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Reference to configured DEM event to report that the JLEF lost synchronization to the local time of the TTCAN controller.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CANIF_TT_E_JLE_SYNC是一个配置项，用于定义CAN接口模块中，针对J1939 Link Error (JLE) 错误的同步传输触发机制。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中未明确提及，因此在实施时需要依据具体的项目需求和CAN接口模块的实现细节来定义；确保与项目中使用的CAN驱动和网络管理模块兼容；在配置时应考虑网络的错误处理策略和性能影响。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00836</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dem/DemConfigSet/DemEventParameter</DESTINATION-REF>
                            </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                          </REFERENCES>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                      </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                  </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:502a51ce-f751-4c9b-924e-ffbae9900c8f">
                  <SHORT-NAME>CanIfPublicCfg</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the public configuration (parameters) of the CAN Interface.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfPublicCfg是CAN接口模块的公共配置参数集合，用于定义CAN接口模块的基本行为和功能，如控制器模式设置、通道定义和消息过滤策略等。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanIfPublicCfg时，需要确保与项目中使用的CAN控制器和网络管理策略相兼容；配置参数应遵循AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对CAN接口模块的要求和约束；对于多CAN通道的项目，需要为每个通道仔细配置相应的参数，避免配置错误导致通信故障。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00246</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <PARAMETERS>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:bda3c206-6356-44a5-b970-b4e664527452">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanIfDevErrorDetect</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Switches the development error detection and notification on or off.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfDevErrorDetect 是一个配置参数，用于启用或禁用 CAN 接口 (CanIf) 模块的开发错误检测和报告机制。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在生产代码中通常会禁用此功能以节省资源，因为它主要用于开发和测试阶段；如果启用，需确保与 DEM (Diagnostic Event Manager) 模块的集成正确配置以处理错误报告；在配置此参数时，应遵循项目的错误处理策略和性能要求。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">* true: detection and notification is enabled.
                                        * false: detection and notification is disabled.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00614</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:53df91c9-50e3-40bd-b080-82d76999435a">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanIfPublicDebugSupport</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">trun on canif cmd.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">CanIfPublicDebugSupport 配置项定义了CANIF维测变量是否参与编译。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanIfPublicDebugSupport时，需要确保为CANIF维测变量预留足够的RAM大小。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">TRUE: Enabled
                                        FALSE: Disabled</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00843</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:fff9c277-fd5b-4ad8-abe0-0d37c399e744">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanIfPublicPnSupport</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Selects support of Partial Network features in CanIf.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfPublicPnSupport配置项用于启用或禁用部分网络（Partial Networking）支持，允许在CAN接口级别上实现网络管理策略，以减少车辆休眠时的能耗。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在使用此配置项时，必须确保底层CAN驱动和网络管理模块支持部分网络特性；此配置项对于实现低功耗模式的车辆网络管理至关重要；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，此配置项的使用应与其他网络管理配置项协同考虑，以确保网络管理策略的一致性和有效性。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">True: Enabled
                                          False: Disabled</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00772</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:389db7b3-a65d-45c4-975b-e3fcb0bcd720">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanIfPublicTxBuffering</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Enables and disables the buffering of transmit L-PDUs (rejected by the CanDrv) within the CAN Interface module.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfPublicTxBuffering 配置项用于定义是否启用CAN接口的公共发送缓冲区，以便管理多个发送请求并优化网络带宽使用。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在启用此配置时，需要确保缓冲区大小和管理策略适当配置以避免数据丢失；此配置项在高负载CAN网络中尤为重要，以保持数据传输的效率和可靠性；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准支持此配置，但具体实现细节可能因供应商而异。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">True: Enabled
                                        False: Disabled</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00618</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>true</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:3879dbb3-a65d-4c45-975b-ecd73fcb0b20">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanIfPublicTxBufferMaxDepthFetchSupport</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">After enabling the CanIfPublicTxBufferMaxDepthFetchSupport configuration item, the maximum usage depth of each CanIfTxBuffer queue will be monitored and recorded during runtime and stored in the RAM resource named CanIfTxBufferMaxDepth, which is helpful for users to reasonably adjust CanIfTxBufferSize according to the actual caniftxbuffer queue usage.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">启用CanIfPublicTxBufferMaxDepthFetchSupport配置项后，将在runtime过程中监测并记录每个CanIfTxBuffer队列的最大使用深度，并存储在RAM资源CanIfTxBufferMaxDepth中，使用户能够根据实际的缓存队列使用情况合理地调整CanIfTxBufferSize。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：此配置仅在CanIfPublicTxBuffering配置为true时可以启用。此外，为了得到合理可靠的最大使用深度，用户需要进行一段时间的长稳维测。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">True: Enabled
                                        False: Disabled</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00618</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:e6648967-6f80-4706-b518-0294ac4290c9">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanIfPublicTxConfirmPollingSupport</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Configuration parameter to enable/disable the API to poll for Tx Confirmation state.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfPublicTxConfirmPollingSupport 是一个配置参数，用于启用或禁用 CAN 接口 (CanIf) 模块中对发送确认的轮询支持，这有助于在不使用中断的情况下确认消息是否已成功发送。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在选择启用轮询机制时，需要确保系统设计能够定期调用轮询函数以检查发送状态；如果系统资源有限或对实时性要求较高，应谨慎使用轮询机制，因为它可能会增加CPU负载；此配置项应与ECU的CAN驱动和网络管理需求保持一致，以确保系统的正确性和性能。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00733</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:f40bc487-2f36-4863-8c3a-5359040783d5">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanIfPublicWakeupCheckValidByNM</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">If enabled, only NM messages shall validate a detected wake-up event in CanIf.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfPublicWakeupCheckValidByNM 是一个配置参数，用于决定是否通过网络管理（NM）检查唤醒源的有效性。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在使用此配置时，必须确保网络管理功能已经集成并正确配置在系统中；此配置项对于实现车辆网络唤醒功能的可靠性至关重要；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，此配置应与其他唤醒相关配置项协同工作，以确保系统的正确响应。该配置项置true时，CanIfPublicWakeupCheckValidSupport也会置为true，并且置灰；当该配置项由true置为false时，CanIfPublicWakeupCheckValidSupport默认保留为true，并取消置灰。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">If disabled, all received messages corresponding to a configured Rx PDU shall validate such a wake-up event.
                                        This parameter depends on CanIfPublicWakeupCheckValidSupport and shall only be configurable, if it is enabled.

                                        True: Enabled
                                        False: Disabled</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00741</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
