                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:51a2279f-2c49-4c87-be76-120819310d0a">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanIfPublicWakeupCheckValidSupport</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Selects support for wake up validation</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfPublicWakeupCheckValidSupport 是一个配置参数，用于启用或禁用 CAN 接口 (CanIf) 模块中的唤醒验证支持功能，以检查接收到的唤醒事件是否有效。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置此参数时，需要确保它与系统中实际的硬件支持和唤醒源需求相匹配；如果硬件不支持唤醒验证，那么启用该功能可能会导致不必要的复杂性或功能不一致；在设计低功耗模式和唤醒逻辑时，应考虑此配置项的设置。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">True: Enabled
                                        False: Disabled</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00611</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:53df91c9-50e3-40bd-b080-82d76999435a">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanIfWakeupSupport</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Enables the CanIf_CheckWakeup API at Pre-Compile-Time. Therefore, this parameter defines if there shall be support for wake-up.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfWakeupSupport 是一个配置项，用于指定CAN接口模块是否支持唤醒功能，这决定了CAN控制器是否能够在网络唤醒事件发生时唤醒ECU。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanIfWakeupSupport时，需要确保硬件支持唤醒功能；此外，应当与ECU的低功耗模式和网络管理需求相协调；如果设置为不支持唤醒，那么在网络唤醒事件发生时，ECU将不会被唤醒。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">TRUE: Enabled
                                        FALSE: Disabled</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00843</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>true</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:53df91c9-50e3-40bd-b080-82d76999435a">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanIfUserTxCalloutSupport</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Enables the Appl_CanIf_Tx_Callout API at Pre-Compile-Time. Therefore, this parameter defines if there shall be support for canif tx callout.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfUserTxCalloutSupport 是一个配置项，用于启用或禁用用户定义的发送回调函数，该函数在CAN接口层发送CAN消息之后被调用。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在使用此配置项时，需要确保已经实现了相应的用户定义回调函数；此配置项的使用可能会影响系统的性能，因为额外的回调函数调用可能会增加系统的处理时间；在配置此项时，应当考虑与其他CAN接口层配置项的兼容性和整体系统设计。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">TRUE: Enabled
                                        FALSE: Disabled</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00843</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:53df91c9-50e3-40bd-b080-82d76999435a">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanIfUserTxConfirmationCalloutSupport</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Enables the Appl_CanIf_TxConfirmation_Callout API at Pre-Compile-Time. Therefore, this parameter defines if there shall be support for canif  txconfirmation callout.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfUserTxConfirmationCalloutSupport 是一个配置项，用于启用或禁用用户定义的发送确认回调函数，这些回调函数在CAN接口层发送成功后被调用。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在使用此配置项时，需要确保已经定义了相应的用户回调函数；此配置项的使用应与系统的实际需求相匹配，避免不必要的开销；如果启用此功能，需要在整个系统中保持一致性，以确保所有相关的发送确认都能得到处理。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">TRUE: Enabled
                                        FALSE: Disabled</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00843</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:53df91c9-50e3-40bd-b080-82d76999435a">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanIfUserRxIndicationCalloutSupport</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Enables the Appl_CanIf_RxIndication_Callout API at Pre-Compile-Time. Therefore, this parameter defines if there shall be support for canif  rxIndication callout.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfUserRxIndicationCalloutSupport 是一个配置项，用于启用或禁用用户定义的接收指示回调函数，这些回调函数在接收到CAN帧时由CAN接口模块调用。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在使用此配置项时，需要确保已经定义了相应的用户回调函数；此配置项的启用可能会影响系统的响应时间和性能；如果项目中不需要处理接收到的CAN消息，则可以禁用此功能以节省资源。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">TRUE: Enabled
                                        FALSE: Disabled</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00843</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
