                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-VARIANTS>
                        <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-CONDITIONAL>
                          <MAX-LENGTH>32</MAX-LENGTH>
                          <MIN-LENGTH>1</MIN-LENGTH>
                        </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-CONDITIONAL>
                      </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-VARIANTS>
                    </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:56f5e13d-6f7f-4078-38af-e014ac45e8e5">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanIfPublicUserCbkHeaderFile</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Defines header files for user callback functions which shall be included in case of CanIfCallout. Range of characters is 1.. 32.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfPublicUserCbkHeaderFile 配置项用于指定用户定义的CAN接口回调函数的头文件名称，这使得用户可以在该头文件中声明自己的回调函数，以便在CAN接口接收或发送消息时被调用。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保指定的头文件存在且包含了所有必要的用户回调函数声明；头文件的命名和路径应符合项目的文件组织结构和编码规范；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，该配置项应与其他CAN接口模块配置保持一致性，避免命名冲突或路径错误。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00671</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-VARIANTS>
                        <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-CONDITIONAL>
                          <MAX-LENGTH>32</MAX-LENGTH>
                          <MIN-LENGTH>1</MIN-LENGTH>
                        </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-CONDITIONAL>
                      </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-VARIANTS>
                    </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF>
                  </PARAMETERS>
                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:771f9925-1a46-450e-8781-b59e18884ef1">
                  <SHORT-NAME>CanIfTrcvDrvCfg</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) of all addressed CAN transceivers by each underlying CAN Transceiver Driver module. For each CAN transceiver Driver a seperate instance of this container shall be provided.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfTrcvDrvCfg 是用于定义CAN接口传输层驱动配置的参数，包括传输层驱动的标识符和相关属性。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保每个传输层驱动配置与其对应的硬件和网络管理需求相匹配；在配置时需遵循AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对CAN接口的具体要求；适当的配置可以优化网络性能和可靠性。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00273</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                  <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                  </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:cbf745e1-f2f4-44fa-8f5c-8b62c0aa1e7c">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanIfTrcvCfg</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) of one addressed CAN transceiver by the underlying CAN Transceiver Driver module. For each CAN transceiver a seperate instance of this container has to be provided.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfTrcvCfg 是一个配置项，用于定义CAN接口层中CAN收发器的配置参数，包括收发器的模式设置、唤醒和睡眠功能等。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanIfTrcvCfg时，需要确保收发器的参数与实际硬件特性相匹配；根据AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准，应当遵循其定义的属性和数据结构；在多个CAN网络中，每个网络的收发器配置应该是唯一的，以避免配置冲突。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00587</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:a8aa0764-c417-48b3-8130-29ebadf1928e">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanIfTrcvWakeupSupport</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines if a respective transceiver of the referenced CAN Transceiver Driver modules is queriable for wake up events.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfTrcvWakeupSupport 配置项用于定义CAN接口传输层是否支持唤醒功能，这决定了传输层是否能够管理和识别网络唤醒事件。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在设计系统时，需要确认硬件支持唤醒功能；此配置应与ECU的低功耗模式和网络管理需求相匹配；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保此配置与Can Transceiver Driver的能力相一致。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">True: Enabled
                                                False: Disabled</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00606</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:570cdbbe-8d21-4e58-8d5f-279580e40b03">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanIfTrcvId</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This parameter abstracts from the CAN Transceiver Driver specific parameter Transceiver. Each transceiver of all connected CAN Transceiver Driver modules shall be assigned to one specific TransceiverId of the CanIf.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfTrcvId 是一个配置参数，用于标识CAN接口层中的CAN收发器（Transceiver）设备的唯一标识符。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时，确保每个CAN收发器有一个唯一的CanIfTrcvId；该标识符通常与CAN驱动层中定义的收发器标识符相对应；在整系统中，CanIfTrcvId 必须保持一致，以便于系统的诊断和管理。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">Range: 0..number of configured transceivers of all CAN Transceiver Driver modules</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00654</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>255</MAX>
                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:0bbaf0c7-4bc2-4004-add9-2e41e44b0cb3">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanTrcvType</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines CanTrcv Type.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanTrcvType配置项用于定义用户层（UL）收发器类型。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：CanTrcvType配置项用于定义用户层（UL）收发器类型。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">If CanIfPublicPnSupport equals False, this parameter shall not be configurable.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00801</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <LITERALS>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:b62b7803-b84f-89f7-44d1-ebb7ca9c05a7">
                              <SHORT-NAME>CanTrcv1145</SHORT-NAME>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:cc72d3b8-839a-9341-2e7d-a76884aeaf48">
                              <SHORT-NAME>CanTrcv1043</SHORT-NAME>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                          </LITERALS>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF UUID="ECUC:8254f029-a3a6-4174-b799-60a500098c1e">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanIfTrcvCanTrcv</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This parameter references to the logical handle of the underlying CAN</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfTrcvCanTrcv 是一个配置参数，用于将CAN接口层的传输控制器引用关联到具体的CAN传输控制器模块。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需要确保引用的CAN传输控制器模块已经在系统中定义并正确配置；此参数通常在CAN接口配置中设置，与具体的硬件和CAN驱动模块紧密相关；在多控制器系统中，每个传输控制器的引用必须是唯一的，以避免配置冲突。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">transceiver from the CAN transceiver driver module to be served by the CAN Interface module.

                                                Range: 0..max. number of underlying supported CAN transceivers</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00605</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                            <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-CONDITIONAL/>
                          </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                        </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF>
                      </PARAMETERS>
                      <REFERENCES>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:8254f029-a3a6-4174-b799-60a500098c1b">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanTrcvWakeupSourceRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Reference to a wakeup source in the EcuM configuration. This reference is only needed if CanTrcvWakeupByBusUsed is true.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanTrcvWakeupSourceRef 配置项用于将CAN收发器（Transceiver）的唤醒源与ECU唤醒源进行关联，确保在CAN网络上的唤醒事件能够被系统正确识别和处理。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保唤醒源的引用正确指向有效的ECU唤醒源对象；如果系统中存在多个CAN收发器，每个收发器的唤醒源应当被唯一标识和配置；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，唤醒源的配置应当与PNC（Partial Network Cluster）或ECU唤醒源的定义相一致。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">transceiver from the CAN transceiver driver module to be served by the CAN Interface module.

                                                Range: 0..max. number of underlying supported CAN transceivers</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00605</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/EcuM/EcuMConfiguration/EcuMCommonConfiguration/EcuMWakeupSource</DESTINATION-REF>
                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:8254f029-a3a6-4174-b799-60a500098c1e">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanIfTrcvChnlToCanIfCtrlChnlRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This parameter references to the logical handle of the underlying CAN</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanIfTrcvChnlToCanIfCtrlChnlRef 配置项用于映射CAN接口的收发器通道到CAN接口控制器通道，确保正确的通信路径和数据流。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保每个收发器通道正确对应到唯一的控制器通道；不遵循此映射规则可能导致数据传输错误或通信失败；在多通道CAN系统中，此配置尤为关键以保证通道间的正确数据隔离和处理。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">transceiver from the CAN transceiver driver module to be served by the CAN Interface module.

                                                Range: 0..max. number of underlying supported CAN transceivers</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanIf_00605</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
